WEBVTT

00:06.089 --> 00:08.091
[theme music playing]

01:03.229 --> 01:05.982
GENIE, MAKE A WISH

01:07.859 --> 01:09.319
[sighs, scoffs]

01:11.613 --> 01:13.823
[whooshing]

01:17.660 --> 01:18.536
[Ka-young sighs]

01:19.245 --> 01:21.539
You were gone all night. Where did you go?

01:22.123 --> 01:24.375
I distinctly remember saying
I'd go change--

01:28.296 --> 01:30.131
[breath trembles]

01:31.216 --> 01:33.593
What's wrong? What is it?

01:37.430 --> 01:39.307
I was paid a visit just now…

01:39.974 --> 01:41.267
[screams]

01:41.768 --> 01:44.187
[Iblis] …by a boy who gave me
my memories back.

01:45.104 --> 01:46.147
[breath shudders]

01:46.940 --> 01:47.941
I caused you to--

01:49.234 --> 01:50.568
[cries]

01:52.695 --> 01:53.988
My arrogance resulted in…

01:55.657 --> 01:57.742
I saw it all. Everything.

01:59.702 --> 02:00.703
[Ka-young sighs]

02:04.749 --> 02:06.000
We are living in the now.

02:06.709 --> 02:09.838
That's in the past, all of that.
It doesn't matter anymore.

02:10.463 --> 02:12.757
You can't bring back the dead
or take us to the future.

02:13.758 --> 02:15.593
But the future is happening now.

02:15.677 --> 02:17.095
It's moment to moment.

02:18.012 --> 02:19.013
But always moving.

02:21.141 --> 02:22.642
The past is closed off.

02:23.309 --> 02:24.519
Don't think of before.

02:25.728 --> 02:27.063
But just think of moving forward.

02:31.609 --> 02:33.444
Even if we don't know how it'll end.

02:39.534 --> 02:41.536
[sniffles] All right.

02:44.372 --> 02:45.206
I can do that.

02:49.919 --> 02:51.796
CHOI DA-JIN
ENTER PASSWORD

02:52.547 --> 02:53.798
INCORRECT PASSWORD

02:55.258 --> 02:58.011
You don't remember the password at all?

02:58.803 --> 03:00.847
[laughs in disbelief]

03:00.930 --> 03:02.765
-Okay, stop joking.
-It's not a joke.

03:02.849 --> 03:05.310
It's driving me crazy too.
I honestly can't remember it.

03:05.393 --> 03:08.187
That two-factor authentication bullshit.
Update the password that way.

03:08.271 --> 03:11.107
I tried, but the verification texts
aren't coming and I'm not sure why.

03:11.190 --> 03:12.901
[groans] Da-jin.

03:14.485 --> 03:16.654
Da-jin, stop messing around, seriously!

03:16.738 --> 03:18.072
I don't know what to tell you!

03:18.156 --> 03:20.450
It's like my brain has
a huge hole in it or something!

03:21.659 --> 03:22.577
-[sighs]
-What?

03:22.660 --> 03:24.162
-Oh, damn it.
-A hole?

03:24.245 --> 03:25.496
[typing]

03:25.580 --> 03:26.915
-[error alert beeps]
-No way.

03:27.498 --> 03:28.583
Second wish. You listening?

03:28.666 --> 03:31.169
I wish she not remember anything!
Da-jin forgets everything!

03:34.047 --> 03:35.381
She forgot everything.

03:36.925 --> 03:38.676
The password counted in the wish?

03:39.344 --> 03:40.303
[sighs]

03:41.137 --> 03:42.639
What are we going to do?

03:43.306 --> 03:45.308
[panting] Yeong-hyeon, I'm sorry.

03:45.391 --> 03:47.310
I mean it. I don't know what happened.

03:47.393 --> 03:50.104
Why I changed the password,
oh, it makes no sense, seriously!

03:51.564 --> 03:54.317
Our wedding anniversary, our first date,

03:55.026 --> 03:59.280
your birthday, the day you asked me
to marry you, it's none of those.

03:59.364 --> 04:00.406
[crying]

04:00.490 --> 04:01.324
Hang on.

04:01.824 --> 04:05.995
So, your passwords
were all things like that?

04:06.079 --> 04:10.041
How did I just forget? I'm going crazy.
I swear… [whimpers]

04:10.124 --> 04:11.876
-Come on. [typing]
-[gasps softly]

04:12.669 --> 04:15.088
-[error alert beeps]
-[typing]

04:15.171 --> 04:17.131
[gloomy music playing]

04:17.882 --> 04:19.217
INCORRECT PASSWORD

04:19.300 --> 04:21.302
[crying]

04:24.055 --> 04:25.056
[error alert beeps]

04:28.101 --> 04:28.977
[whimpers]

04:30.311 --> 04:31.229
Da-jin.

04:32.063 --> 04:33.189
It'll be fine.

04:33.731 --> 04:34.816
Your father…

04:36.192 --> 04:37.235
will recover.

04:38.361 --> 04:40.613
Hmm? What did you say?

04:42.198 --> 04:43.533
Wait, where are you going?

04:45.493 --> 04:47.829
-[Mi-ju sighs]
-[door opens]

04:48.579 --> 04:49.455
Ka-young.

04:51.457 --> 04:54.752
What's going on? What is all this?
What's happening?

04:54.836 --> 04:56.546
That bastard dropped your name
to the cops.

04:56.629 --> 04:58.965
-It's all right. It's all right.
-[sighs]

04:59.507 --> 05:01.092
It's going to be all right.

05:01.801 --> 05:03.386
Let's get out of here. You too, Min-ji.

05:03.469 --> 05:06.514
We need to keep you hidden for now.
I know a place.

05:06.597 --> 05:09.726
You're right. We can't let bastards
like him put us in even worse danger.

05:10.310 --> 05:11.602
Hiding is a good idea.

05:11.686 --> 05:14.981
We can discuss more once we're there.
Where is it? Nearby?

05:18.318 --> 05:19.610
[pills rattle]

05:21.988 --> 05:23.698
What about the wake for Heung-Rye…

05:24.574 --> 05:26.034
[Ka-young] I'll make a contribution.

05:26.117 --> 05:28.244
For now, just take this
and get some sleep.

05:29.037 --> 05:32.332
I have to go for a while.
I have to do something to resolve this.

05:33.374 --> 05:36.794
No matter what,
you have to stay here, Grandma.

05:38.004 --> 05:39.839
-Okay?
-All right.

05:41.215 --> 05:44.844
Promise me to be careful.
You're going with her, yes?

05:45.553 --> 05:49.390
Mm-hmm. I am, Oh Pan-geum.
I'll stay with her the whole time.

05:56.856 --> 05:59.484
-That thing I said I'd tell you later…
-Forget it.

06:00.068 --> 06:02.820
Already figured it out.
She's Grandma, I know.

06:03.446 --> 06:06.616
I'll consider this a housewarming.
She and I can make ourselves cozy.

06:06.699 --> 06:09.744
[sighs] You've got a nice home in here,
more or less.

06:09.827 --> 06:11.162
[Sade] Dinner delivery!

06:13.664 --> 06:15.833
-[exhales]
-If you need anything, just tell him.

06:17.376 --> 06:19.587
Sade, protect them with your life.

06:19.670 --> 06:21.297
Yes, Master. I'm on it.

06:22.507 --> 06:23.841
Jjajangmyeon, jjambbong,

06:23.925 --> 06:26.177
-which one do you want?
-A genie, his beast,

06:26.761 --> 06:29.430
and a lamp that looks like
a billionaire's penthouse.

06:29.514 --> 06:33.184
Despite witnessing all of this magic,
I would still like to express

06:33.267 --> 06:35.269
I still think we evolved from monkeys.

06:37.480 --> 06:38.564
Hmm?

06:40.108 --> 06:42.193
Yeah… That's, uh…

06:42.944 --> 06:45.279
Uh, we can discuss that another time.

06:45.363 --> 06:47.490
Why don't you get some rest for now?

06:47.573 --> 06:48.407
Oh, you little…

06:51.077 --> 06:53.538
-Kim Ha-neul, you found your toy, huh?
-Yeah.

06:53.621 --> 06:56.165
See? You found it like I said,
because you had a proper look.

06:56.249 --> 06:58.626
But you had to throw a tantrum,
cry and scream, didn't you?

06:58.709 --> 07:01.420
So where was it? I swear,
we looked all over, up and down.

07:01.504 --> 07:04.382
Ppoppi hid it. He told me where it was.

07:05.049 --> 07:07.927
Come on, Ha-neul. You know Ppoppi
lives on a farm now, like we said.

07:08.511 --> 07:12.014
It's true. Ppoppi whispered it
to me, remember?

07:12.098 --> 07:13.141
In my ear.

07:16.644 --> 07:18.980
-What's wrong?
-[pensive music plays]

07:20.982 --> 07:22.066
[Chauffeur Kim sighs]

07:25.236 --> 07:28.114
[Chauffeur Kim] In a past life, I was
a member of a reconnaissance unit.

07:28.197 --> 07:30.241
I inherited a life-changing sum of money

07:30.324 --> 07:32.535
from an anonymous donor,
someone I do not know.

07:33.286 --> 07:35.121
But I have no recollection
of this happening.

07:35.621 --> 07:39.333
In situations like these,
there are three options. The first one…

07:39.417 --> 07:40.251
Turn it in.

07:42.336 --> 07:43.379
The second option…

07:44.088 --> 07:45.715
NEAT STACK SAFE

07:46.466 --> 07:47.425
Hide it.

07:49.260 --> 07:50.595
[sighs]

07:50.678 --> 07:52.472
The third and final option…

07:52.555 --> 07:53.556
[dog barking]

07:55.641 --> 07:56.809
[panting]

08:04.400 --> 08:05.902
You must have been abandoned.

08:07.945 --> 08:09.947
-Would you like to come with me?
-[whimpers]

08:10.031 --> 08:12.158
I have many others like you at my house.

08:14.202 --> 08:17.205
Ah, but before that,
what should we call you?

08:20.875 --> 08:21.792
Ppoppi.

08:23.586 --> 08:25.004
Yes, Ppoppi sounds great.

08:26.589 --> 08:27.423
[chuckles softly]

08:28.007 --> 08:29.300
-[whimpers]
-Chauffeur Choi.

08:32.011 --> 08:33.638
All right. Let's get going.

08:36.474 --> 08:38.226
I chose the third option.

08:39.060 --> 08:42.021
It's strange. Though I long for answers,

08:42.104 --> 08:44.232
I feel I will be forever waiting for them.

08:46.234 --> 08:48.110
The anonymous still have names.

08:48.736 --> 08:51.113
I'm currently an abandoned dog detective.

08:51.697 --> 08:55.034
My duty is to find those of you
who have abandoned your pets.

08:55.618 --> 08:56.827
[door opens]

09:03.209 --> 09:05.378
[Wahid] Have you still not made
your decision?

09:06.128 --> 09:07.505
Well, that just won't do.

09:10.174 --> 09:11.884
[choking]

09:13.302 --> 09:16.055
I don't know why you're pushing off
the inevitable like this.

09:16.639 --> 09:20.059
All you need to do right now is sing
the world to sleep this very minute!

09:20.142 --> 09:22.019
[choking]

09:22.103 --> 09:24.105
You better follow Father's orders

09:25.147 --> 09:27.149
so Iblis can be tied up for good.

09:27.233 --> 09:29.819
-[breathing heavily]
-[man continues choking]

09:31.612 --> 09:34.991
-[beeps, chimes]
-[automated voice] Door opening.

09:47.503 --> 09:48.963
[beeping]

09:50.423 --> 09:51.591
[unlocks, chimes]

10:02.685 --> 10:04.854
What the hell are you up to now,
you psycho?

10:06.564 --> 10:09.650
All this cash is yours,
just let me buy your remaining wish.

10:10.526 --> 10:13.029
If you don't, I'll set fire
to this entire bag of cash.

10:13.112 --> 10:16.407
You do know that I will burn it
without hesitation.

10:17.199 --> 10:19.994
And whatever you use your wish for,
I'll just undo it with mine,

10:20.077 --> 10:24.457
so it's really in your best interest
to just let me use your wish.

10:25.333 --> 10:26.417
So, I'm asking.

10:28.878 --> 10:30.796
Take the cash, Gu Bo-gyeong.

10:37.511 --> 10:38.721
How can I trust you?

10:38.804 --> 10:41.682
What we need to establish
between me and you is not trust.

10:42.308 --> 10:43.726
It's rules, because I know rules.

10:44.393 --> 10:47.229
You give me your wish,
I give you this money.

10:47.813 --> 10:50.232
That's it. This is our one rule.

10:52.902 --> 10:54.904
[suspenseful music playing]

11:04.497 --> 11:06.040
So I'm to wish for?

11:14.465 --> 11:15.925
[bowls clattering]

11:26.394 --> 11:27.395
[soft boom]

11:34.068 --> 11:34.902
[sighs]

11:36.737 --> 11:38.114
I'm ready for my final wish.

11:40.991 --> 11:44.453
But tell that bitch, Ka-young,
I did exactly what she asked.

11:45.037 --> 11:46.205
[breathing shakily]

11:46.288 --> 11:48.040
[tense music playing]

11:48.124 --> 11:49.333
[breathing heavily]

11:53.170 --> 11:55.214
[whooshing]

11:57.758 --> 11:59.760
[ominous music plays]

12:05.224 --> 12:08.477
In your previous life, you sold out
hundreds in order to get into heaven.

12:09.186 --> 12:12.481
And here you are once again, destroying
chances for others, Ms. Ki Ka-young.

12:13.149 --> 12:14.733
That's rich coming from you.

12:14.817 --> 12:16.861
You bullied a small child.

12:17.445 --> 12:21.198
You made me use up my wish
so Iblis would suffer the consequences.

12:21.282 --> 12:23.784
You're doing it in this life too.
Get lost.

12:23.868 --> 12:25.703
All I did is state what happened.

12:25.786 --> 12:27.621
What happened isn't the whole truth.

12:27.705 --> 12:29.165
I hate to break it to you,

12:29.248 --> 12:32.376
it doesn't matter what you do,
Iblis will perish by my hand.

12:33.544 --> 12:36.172
I followed his orders,
I bowed down to mankind.

12:36.255 --> 12:39.258
However, Iblis disobeyed his every word.

12:39.341 --> 12:43.721
Not for one minute has Iblis ever followed
his orders obediently.

12:43.804 --> 12:47.266
The fact that he still shows
that shaytan grace to this day

12:47.349 --> 12:49.226
has to be so that I can complete my task.

12:49.310 --> 12:51.270
It means that me slitting his throat

12:52.813 --> 12:55.691
will be the thing that elevates me
to his right hand side.

12:55.774 --> 12:57.776
[ominous music continues]

13:00.613 --> 13:03.115
What the hell? It's like talking
to an engineering student.

13:03.199 --> 13:04.533
Ugh, my arm hurts.

13:05.159 --> 13:07.161
Look, Mr. Angel, whatever,

13:08.412 --> 13:09.997
you're committing the sin of envy.

13:10.581 --> 13:13.292
And what's worse?
You have an inferiority complex.

13:13.375 --> 13:16.170
It's more complicated than that.
I act only for His--

13:16.253 --> 13:17.796
Oh, shut up!

13:18.923 --> 13:22.009
You will never be able to slit
Iblis' throat. Do you know why?

13:22.551 --> 13:24.053
[tense music plays]

13:24.136 --> 13:26.722
I will wish for something so very selfish.

13:29.016 --> 13:29.934
I…

13:32.603 --> 13:33.771
have never…

13:35.773 --> 13:37.358
known what goodness is.

13:38.651 --> 13:40.653
[tense music intensifies]

13:46.367 --> 13:47.201
[music stops]

13:52.748 --> 13:55.876
[bird cawing]

13:59.463 --> 14:01.799
[bird cawing]

14:18.274 --> 14:20.568
-[button clicks]
-[projector whirring]

14:20.651 --> 14:22.278
[wistful music plays]

14:22.361 --> 14:24.071
JOY

14:26.574 --> 14:29.034
DESPAIR

14:31.537 --> 14:33.330
LONGING

14:33.414 --> 14:34.832
WAITING

14:39.128 --> 14:40.546
MIN-JI'S EMOTIONS ARE SO EASY

14:40.629 --> 14:42.506
RULE: NEVER SNEER AT PEOPLE LIKE THIS

14:43.883 --> 14:46.510
[Ka-young] I knew you'd eventually
take a peek, you satan.

14:46.594 --> 14:49.138
Switch it off when done.
You'll drive up the electricity bill.

14:49.847 --> 14:50.681
[chuckles]

14:52.600 --> 14:53.726
[door opens]

14:59.148 --> 15:01.317
Did you meet Gu Bo-gyeong?
She hasn't forgotten yet.

15:01.859 --> 15:05.404
She follow through? She make the wish?
Tell me now.

15:06.655 --> 15:07.740
Yes, so did Ko Yeong-hyeon.

15:09.241 --> 15:11.410
The kindness of humans… [chuckles softly]

15:11.493 --> 15:12.620
is quite surprising.

15:13.329 --> 15:14.246
They were not corrupt.

15:16.165 --> 15:17.207
Really?

15:18.292 --> 15:20.628
Hey, wake up. Ko Yeong-hyeon, get up.

15:20.711 --> 15:21.837
-[groaning]
-Hurry, wake up!

15:22.796 --> 15:25.591
-What happened? How did you know?
-Whoa, what's wrong?

15:25.674 --> 15:28.177
Why are you-- Why are you crying?
What's wrong?

15:28.677 --> 15:30.554
-What do you mean?
-You said, "It'll be fine."

15:30.638 --> 15:32.181
-"Your father will recover."
-Huh?

15:32.723 --> 15:35.100
Apparently,
my father's cancer is all gone.

15:35.809 --> 15:37.186
They have no idea what happened.

15:37.269 --> 15:39.063
-The doctor's saying it's a miracle.
-Really?

15:39.146 --> 15:40.814
-Yes!
-Wow, that's wonderful!

15:41.607 --> 15:42.524
Wait a minute.

15:43.108 --> 15:45.486
Did I really say something like that?

15:46.070 --> 15:46.904
When?

15:47.529 --> 15:49.573
-[grunts]
-Thank you, Yeong-hyeon.

15:50.157 --> 15:52.284
It feels like he recovered because of you.

15:52.910 --> 15:54.495
-Like some form of magic.
-Okay.

15:54.578 --> 15:56.330
-[cell phone vibrating]
-Someone's calling.

15:56.413 --> 15:57.665
[gasps] Oh, my goodness.

15:59.541 --> 16:00.376
Dad.

16:01.168 --> 16:03.504
Yes, I was just telling him the good news.
He's thrilled.

16:03.587 --> 16:04.421
What?

16:05.005 --> 16:07.925
Uh, slow down. What messages?
You're getting texts all of a sudden?

16:09.551 --> 16:11.887
Authentication messages
for YouTube account?

16:11.971 --> 16:13.847
-They were being sent to you?
-Authentication?

16:13.931 --> 16:17.309
Dad, you should be getting another message
right now. Read it out to me.

16:17.393 --> 16:18.310
-Yeong-hyeon.
-Huh?

16:18.394 --> 16:20.562
We can get our account back online again.

16:20.646 --> 16:22.606
Views are up to six hundred thousand!

16:23.857 --> 16:26.402
-Yes.
-Six hundred thousand? Wait.

16:26.485 --> 16:29.655
Our video has nearly
six hundred thousand views total?

16:29.738 --> 16:31.407
-[Da-jin chuckles]
-[gasps]

16:32.074 --> 16:33.075
-Hey!
-Huh?

16:33.158 --> 16:35.244
-Did you show them your breasts?
-What?

16:36.078 --> 16:37.746
-Ugh, asshole!
-Hey! [groans]

16:37.830 --> 16:40.332
-How dare you! How can you ask that?
-[yelping] I'm sorry.

16:41.375 --> 16:43.085
So, that means I won?

16:44.503 --> 16:45.838
I won in the end?

16:45.921 --> 16:48.173
I'd say Gu Bo-gyeong's final wish
half counts.

16:48.757 --> 16:53.345
So, I guess I could try to make my case
that you and I have tied. [chuckles]

16:54.805 --> 16:55.764
I'm heading off.

16:56.557 --> 16:58.308
Don't forget to track me down and save me.

17:02.062 --> 17:02.896
Now?

17:03.981 --> 17:04.815
Already?

17:04.898 --> 17:07.234
Every fight has been won
by whoever strikes first.

17:08.068 --> 17:11.196
Don't worry. I've never lost
against anybody but you.

17:12.156 --> 17:14.158
-[gentle music plays]
-[sighs]

17:39.975 --> 17:41.977
[crying softly]

17:50.486 --> 17:53.030
[Ejllael] In a situation where
one of you two must be destroyed,

17:53.864 --> 17:57.743
you still entertain the impossible hope
that you will both get to live, Iblis.

17:58.452 --> 18:00.829
[Irem] As it stands now,
Iblis and Ms. Ki Ka-young

18:00.913 --> 18:03.165
will almost certainly
try to save each other.

18:05.417 --> 18:07.503
At the very least, Ms. Ki Ka-young will.

18:09.713 --> 18:12.925
[sighs] They'll prevent me
from finishing this war.

18:14.718 --> 18:15.761
[Irem] War?

18:18.889 --> 18:20.891
[tense music plays]

18:32.903 --> 18:35.948
-[knife slashes]
-[gagging]

18:47.584 --> 18:49.503
[Shadi] Stop! All right.

18:50.087 --> 18:53.215
I will sing the world to sleep.
And I will bind Iblis.

18:53.799 --> 18:56.510
[exhales] Finally, today is the day.

18:57.219 --> 18:59.471
Today? Has today finally come, Father?

19:00.055 --> 19:02.057
I will be the one who tied down the genie.

19:03.642 --> 19:06.353
My healing powers don't work
when this thread cuts me.

19:10.149 --> 19:13.235
-[giggles maliciously]
-I can simply not hear his music.

19:14.570 --> 19:16.113
-[grunts]
-[Shadi] Khalid!

19:20.576 --> 19:21.702
[chuckles]

19:26.123 --> 19:27.875
[Khalid] Right. Now, sing!

19:27.958 --> 19:30.627
[whooshing]

19:33.922 --> 19:35.841
Iblis has come of his own accord.

19:38.218 --> 19:41.263
Sing, Father. I told you to sing now!

19:41.346 --> 19:42.264
[metal thuds]

19:42.347 --> 19:44.349
[dark music plays]

19:46.476 --> 19:48.770
-[owl hoots]
-[birds squawking]

19:55.736 --> 19:56.695
[hoots]

19:57.446 --> 19:59.907
There's something you'll have to do
when that day comes.

19:59.990 --> 20:02.326
That's all I expect you to do. Got it?

20:03.660 --> 20:04.494
[hoots]

20:05.495 --> 20:07.497
[dark music continues]

20:29.770 --> 20:31.939
[Khalid in deep voice]
Finally, we meet again.

20:32.022 --> 20:35.067
I have waited for you for 1,000 years.

20:35.150 --> 20:37.402
You have finally made it here.

20:38.570 --> 20:41.406
[in normal voice] I received something
of immense value today.

20:41.490 --> 20:42.658
I'm very grateful.

20:49.706 --> 20:52.334
[Shadi] Then,
will you grant me freedom, my son?

20:52.918 --> 20:55.128
Yes, of course. However,

20:56.171 --> 20:58.215
I shall first give freedom to myself.

20:58.882 --> 21:00.425
-[gags]
-Shadi!

21:00.509 --> 21:01.385
[yells]

21:05.931 --> 21:07.140
[panting]

21:07.224 --> 21:10.143
Do not forget my last request.

21:10.227 --> 21:11.061
[Shadi gasps]

21:12.479 --> 21:13.522
[Shadi exhales]

21:15.482 --> 21:19.236
[Shadi] Up until this moment,
I've done everything I could, my brother.

21:19.778 --> 21:21.363
[chimes]

21:23.073 --> 21:25.284
-[tense music playing]
-[breathing heavily]

21:26.410 --> 21:29.162
You do not have human empathy,

21:30.956 --> 21:33.000
nor the generosity of a spirit.

21:34.584 --> 21:36.044
Your demise by my hand…

21:37.879 --> 21:39.089
is now guaranteed.

21:39.631 --> 21:40.966
Are you angry?

21:41.925 --> 21:44.052
You're being quite harsh on a deaf orphan.

21:48.765 --> 21:51.018
What about the girl?
Has she been captured?

21:54.229 --> 21:56.815
[breathing heavily]

22:03.530 --> 22:05.532
[whirring]

22:09.036 --> 22:10.537
[grunting]

22:13.373 --> 22:15.959
It is time for me to take the lamp
once and for all.

22:16.752 --> 22:17.919
So make your last wish.

22:18.003 --> 22:20.547
Any resistance will bring harm
to those you love.

22:20.630 --> 22:24.551
Your grandmother, your friend,
all the people in your village.

22:24.634 --> 22:27.346
Wish the lamp over to me
and let's be done with it.

22:28.638 --> 22:29.681
A zero-sum game, huh?

22:31.266 --> 22:35.228
[sighs] Okay. You'll stop going on
about how we're connected.

22:36.605 --> 22:39.357
Go off as much as you want,
you son of a bitch!

22:40.067 --> 22:40.901
End quote.

22:41.485 --> 22:44.613
What are you saying?
Give me your wish already!

22:45.739 --> 22:46.573
[grunts]

22:48.784 --> 22:51.078
What the hell? Where did she go?

22:51.161 --> 22:53.997
That bitch used up her final wish
on this bullshit?

22:54.081 --> 22:56.291
Find her. Track her down now!

22:56.374 --> 22:57.751
Yes!

23:02.005 --> 23:03.673
What do you want me to wish for?

23:03.757 --> 23:07.969
When Ki Ka-young says, "Go off as much
as you want, you son of a bitch,"

23:08.053 --> 23:09.262
wherever she may be,

23:10.138 --> 23:12.516
take Ka-young immediately
to Iblis' location.

23:13.141 --> 23:14.726
Use those precise words.

23:15.310 --> 23:17.771
-You got all that?
-Yeah, I'm not an idiot.

23:28.615 --> 23:30.700
[music building]

23:33.995 --> 23:35.747
-[music stops]
-[Ka-young panting]

23:39.793 --> 23:40.961
[grunting]

23:44.965 --> 23:47.342
-[sighs]
-Damn, they use a lot of thread.

23:54.599 --> 23:56.226
Well, that's what I've got.

23:57.394 --> 24:00.605
-Don't know what to do now.
-That's okay, I'll take it from here.

24:00.689 --> 24:04.442
We have the thread. I'll take it with me
and bring it to my brother's garden.

24:05.735 --> 24:08.864
You two, follow me.
The rest, spread out! Find her!

24:11.199 --> 24:14.035
[Iblis] He's half human, half spirit.
The thread is fatal for him too.

24:14.619 --> 24:15.745
Let's see if I can carry it.

24:16.872 --> 24:18.165
Carry it.

24:21.042 --> 24:23.295
-[straining]
-[low whirring]

24:23.378 --> 24:24.588
Don't worry about me, just go.

24:24.671 --> 24:27.215
Go now. Get rid of him for good.

24:34.723 --> 24:35.557
[exhales]

24:36.433 --> 24:38.518
[tense music plays]

24:39.102 --> 24:41.688
[owl hooting]

24:42.397 --> 24:44.691
[muffled yelling]

24:44.774 --> 24:46.943
-[all shouting]
-[Mi-ju] What is happening?

24:47.027 --> 24:48.445
[Min-ji] Oh, I feel sick.

24:48.528 --> 24:50.614
Someone must be carrying the lamp
right now.

24:51.489 --> 24:53.450
[all yelp]

24:53.533 --> 24:54.784
[panting]

24:54.868 --> 24:58.038
What is this? I'll go out
and find out what's happening.

25:08.381 --> 25:10.217
Who are you? A mythical beast?

25:12.552 --> 25:13.386
[Sade pants]

25:13.929 --> 25:15.013
Irem? What?

25:20.310 --> 25:21.770
This is a gift from Ejllael.

25:22.437 --> 25:23.271
From Ejllael?

25:29.778 --> 25:30.779
This is it.

25:32.113 --> 25:33.490
It's Iblis' lamp.

25:35.617 --> 25:37.452
Irem. What are you doing?

25:37.953 --> 25:40.747
I told you that one day
you would need to choose.

25:41.498 --> 25:43.250
I serve only my master and no one else.

25:43.333 --> 25:45.377
This is what your master ordered? No way!

25:45.460 --> 25:47.587
That is not for mythical beasts to ask.

25:48.588 --> 25:49.798
We do as we're told.

25:53.718 --> 25:54.761
[Sade] Irem!

25:58.390 --> 26:00.141
Hang on. How come I still see it?

26:01.935 --> 26:04.562
They said it would evaporate
the minute her wishes were made.

26:06.648 --> 26:08.483
She still has a wish left?

26:09.776 --> 26:10.694
She deceived me.

26:11.736 --> 26:14.239
[sighs] That bitch.

26:15.365 --> 26:16.908
Go find her.

26:16.992 --> 26:19.452
Whatever it takes. Go find her now!

26:19.536 --> 26:21.329
-[men] Yes, ma'am!
-Stop!

26:23.832 --> 26:25.000
I'll kill you all.

26:27.544 --> 26:28.712
[growling]

26:34.467 --> 26:38.054
[Ka-young] The day birds fall dead
from the sky, that is the day.

26:38.763 --> 26:40.015
Please come save us.

26:40.098 --> 26:42.559
[tense music plays]

26:43.601 --> 26:45.312
-[yells]
-[Sade snarls]

26:46.438 --> 26:48.565
[men yelping and screaming]

26:49.858 --> 26:51.735
[screaming]

26:53.069 --> 26:54.946
[growls]

26:56.531 --> 26:59.242
[men yelping]

27:01.411 --> 27:02.829
[metal clangs]

27:04.622 --> 27:05.457
Huh?

27:14.341 --> 27:15.884
[solemn music plays]

27:28.563 --> 27:30.857
[whirring]

27:40.658 --> 27:42.911
[grunts softly]

27:53.630 --> 27:56.508
-[whooshes]
-[wind gusting]

27:58.301 --> 28:00.220
You're not here to say hi, are you?

28:01.012 --> 28:02.055
[sighs]

28:05.975 --> 28:07.685
I'm a little busy at the moment.

28:10.480 --> 28:14.192
[sighs] There isn't much time left
until Ka-young's last wish.

28:14.275 --> 28:15.527
I thought I'd stall.

28:16.194 --> 28:18.571
If you destroy that flower
before she makes it,

28:20.156 --> 28:22.283
that ruins everything I've worked towards.

28:23.118 --> 28:24.369
Your painting.

28:26.746 --> 28:28.581
You asked why I bore out the eyes.

28:30.667 --> 28:31.668
I saw their ambitions.

28:32.419 --> 28:35.672
This, right here,
is the ambition of the angels.

28:37.173 --> 28:39.175
Still fighting that 300-year war.

28:40.343 --> 28:43.012
-Even now.
-You really thought the war had been won?

28:43.847 --> 28:45.932
Where is the peace our battle won us?

28:47.100 --> 28:49.060
You should've never removed that sword.

28:49.894 --> 28:52.147
That sword brought calamity to us angels.

28:52.856 --> 28:55.984
Nor should you
have ever met her again either.

28:57.152 --> 29:01.781
Seeing as you've recovered your memories,
it should be clear how that ends. [scoffs]

29:03.158 --> 29:05.660
I hope Ka-young's wish is a righteous one.

29:05.744 --> 29:07.704
I will then slit your throat.

29:08.329 --> 29:09.914
She'll go back to how she always was.

29:11.291 --> 29:14.586
She'll forget you
and go back to her life of torment,

29:14.669 --> 29:15.837
ostracized, denounced.

29:16.880 --> 29:20.759
Because that is the appropriate fate
for a human who is loved by a satan.

29:21.801 --> 29:24.345
Just as it was, it will be again.

29:26.139 --> 29:27.599
I too hope her wish

29:29.642 --> 29:31.811
is a noble wish, whatever it may be.

29:32.687 --> 29:34.230
She may not know goodness,

29:35.064 --> 29:37.692
but she saw to it that
she only made good choices.

29:39.652 --> 29:41.946
I hope the rest of her life is peaceful.

29:42.989 --> 29:44.616
Her memories will vanish.

29:45.992 --> 29:48.953
She'll go back to her life,
rebuked for being a psychopath.

29:49.662 --> 29:51.247
Her life indeed may be boring again…

29:51.831 --> 29:52.749
[sighs]

29:52.832 --> 29:54.501
…but she would still be righteous,

29:55.084 --> 29:57.712
she'd still be worthy of love,
just as he intended.

29:59.672 --> 30:02.133
That, right there,
is why I met her in this life.

30:04.427 --> 30:06.095
So that the end of this war

30:07.847 --> 30:09.599
would give heaven to Ki Ka-young.

30:18.316 --> 30:19.859
And so you will…

30:21.110 --> 30:22.195
bow to her.

30:22.278 --> 30:23.279
[inhales sharply]

30:28.576 --> 30:29.744
[grunts]

30:33.498 --> 30:34.332
[both grunt]

30:35.083 --> 30:36.084
[cell phone chimes]

30:38.711 --> 30:41.089
CONVENIENCE STORE CLERK
FORMER MARINE, CLASS 1185

30:41.172 --> 30:42.006
[cell phone chimes]

30:44.008 --> 30:44.843
[sighs]

30:47.554 --> 30:49.305
STRAWBERRY FARMER
WELTERWEIGHT CHAMPION

30:49.389 --> 30:51.224
CAFE OWNER, NEW CIVVIE
ALL FORMER MARINES

30:51.307 --> 30:52.267
CHEONGPUNG MARINES

30:52.350 --> 30:53.434
PARK CHANG-SIK

30:53.518 --> 30:55.103
[Chang-sik] Operation Cave Cleaning.

30:57.063 --> 30:59.399
[dramatic music plays]

31:02.819 --> 31:05.989
Whatever it takes!
If it doesn't work, make it work!

31:06.072 --> 31:07.532
No stopping until it's done.

31:09.075 --> 31:11.744
All right. Let's go!

31:14.080 --> 31:16.624
-[dramatic music continues]
-[grunts]

31:17.792 --> 31:19.460
[both grunting]

31:47.989 --> 31:48.907
[Ejllael yells]

31:51.159 --> 31:52.368
[Iblis grunts]

31:53.786 --> 31:55.079
[thunder rumbling]

31:57.665 --> 31:58.666
[Ejllael yells]

31:58.750 --> 32:00.585
[both grunting]

32:05.757 --> 32:07.091
[yells]

32:07.175 --> 32:09.135
[both grunting]

32:22.857 --> 32:23.983
[groans] Shit!

32:24.067 --> 32:26.819
-[cackles]
-[Iblis straining]

32:34.494 --> 32:36.245
-[thunder rumbling]
-[panting]

32:40.416 --> 32:42.585
Who are you? How did you get in here?

32:43.544 --> 32:45.964
Are you another genie or whatever?

32:46.047 --> 32:47.215
Sorry, I'm deaf.

32:48.549 --> 32:50.677
Your granddaughter's outside,
waiting for you.

32:50.760 --> 32:51.761
Ka-young is here?

32:52.887 --> 32:55.139
Hang on. Who are you?

32:56.015 --> 32:58.851
Where did you get that thread there?

33:01.104 --> 33:03.022
-[men grunting]
-[growling]

33:04.899 --> 33:06.609
[screaming]

33:11.280 --> 33:13.366
[screaming]

33:14.993 --> 33:17.787
[men screaming and grunting]

33:21.040 --> 33:21.874
[screams]

33:22.417 --> 33:25.670
Oh Pan-geum, do not let go
of my hand, got it?

33:25.753 --> 33:28.423
What the hell are you saying
to each other? Don't speak at all.

33:28.506 --> 33:29.507
I'm in charge!

33:30.758 --> 33:32.176
[gasps]

33:32.260 --> 33:34.637
Your bitch granddaughter made
my father angry,

33:34.721 --> 33:36.723
so a few corpses
should return the favor nicely.

33:37.473 --> 33:39.517
Which order should I lay them out in?

33:40.268 --> 33:42.061
I guess the friend first,

33:42.729 --> 33:44.272
and then relative second, no?

33:44.814 --> 33:46.065
Kill her now.

33:47.567 --> 33:48.901
[Mi-ju] Who are you people?

33:50.111 --> 33:51.738
What's happening?

33:51.821 --> 33:52.822
[growls]

33:53.656 --> 33:55.533
-[snarling]
-[men scream]

33:58.202 --> 33:59.704
-[Sade growls]
-[man screams]

33:59.787 --> 34:01.456
-[Wahid] Father!
-[Khalid whimpering]

34:04.751 --> 34:05.668
[gasps]

34:06.627 --> 34:07.920
The day has come.

34:09.797 --> 34:11.507
Not spring, but today.

34:11.591 --> 34:13.551
-Grandma, you try to break it.
-[grunts]

34:14.927 --> 34:17.055
Oh, whoa. It was easy before.

34:17.805 --> 34:21.059
[Ejllael] When the flowers next bloom
in your front yard…

34:21.142 --> 34:22.143
Oh, Lord.

34:22.226 --> 34:23.352
[Ejllael] …you will die.

34:23.436 --> 34:24.270
What is it?

34:26.439 --> 34:30.401
Min-ji, tell Ka-young everything
I tell you now.

34:30.485 --> 34:33.404
The exact words.
[breath trembles, sniffles]

34:33.946 --> 34:38.159
Ka-young, you were the biggest blessing.

34:39.285 --> 34:42.538
You're smarter than anyone.
You're beautiful.

34:42.622 --> 34:44.791
You've never been a bad granddaughter.

34:45.374 --> 34:49.879
Ka-young, don't you dare make the wrong
choice because of me, do you understand?

34:49.962 --> 34:51.631
Tell her… Tell her this, okay?

34:52.799 --> 34:55.343
Yes, I will, I promise.
But right now, let's run.

34:55.426 --> 34:57.261
-[groaning]
-[growls]

34:57.345 --> 34:58.179
[man yelps]

34:59.680 --> 35:00.765
[yelps]

35:09.273 --> 35:10.316
[grunts]

35:11.067 --> 35:12.276
[growls, screams]

35:13.820 --> 35:15.279
[bellows]

35:17.573 --> 35:18.574
Seo I-deuk!

35:20.076 --> 35:20.993
[Wahid] Kill her!

35:22.203 --> 35:23.663
No, Min-ji!

35:25.873 --> 35:26.707
[gunshot]

35:28.918 --> 35:32.046
[sorrowful music plays]

35:34.048 --> 35:36.175
Mm, odd for a man to have this.

35:40.179 --> 35:41.722
[humming]

35:46.477 --> 35:51.315
I made the flowers bloom in the front yard
with my own hands.

35:52.024 --> 35:53.860
[gasps]

35:54.735 --> 35:57.488
-[coughing]
-[cries out]

35:57.572 --> 36:00.741
No, Grandma! No! No!

36:01.409 --> 36:03.244
Mi-ju! No!

36:03.327 --> 36:05.121
[crying] Mi-ju, please!

36:06.455 --> 36:07.456
This can't be!

36:09.208 --> 36:12.420
This is the wrong order!
I said to kill the other bitch first!

36:12.503 --> 36:13.754
[Min-ji sobbing]

36:16.048 --> 36:17.967
-[Min-ji] No!
-You bitch, what are you--

36:18.551 --> 36:20.261
Spit it out. Spit it out right now!

36:20.887 --> 36:21.721
[gulps]

36:21.804 --> 36:25.224
-Open her stomach. Take the thread out!
-No, please, don't do that.

36:25.308 --> 36:27.560
-I beg of you, please! Please!
-[exhales]

36:27.643 --> 36:28.978
No! No!

36:29.562 --> 36:30.980
[growls]

36:32.064 --> 36:34.650
[man] No! [screaming]

36:37.820 --> 36:38.946
[growls weakly]

36:41.616 --> 36:44.202
[dramatic orchestral music plays]

36:47.872 --> 36:48.998
Sade.

36:55.046 --> 36:56.047
[grunts]

37:01.802 --> 37:03.387
[straining]

37:05.765 --> 37:06.682
[grunts]

37:08.809 --> 37:10.895
[yelps, screams]

37:15.524 --> 37:17.985
-[panting]
-[thunder rumbling]

37:19.237 --> 37:21.030
[Ka-young panting]

37:25.159 --> 37:26.786
[tense music plays]

37:28.663 --> 37:29.664
Grandma?

37:31.290 --> 37:33.000
-Grandma?
-Grandma!

37:33.542 --> 37:36.587
It's all my fault! [sobbing]

37:39.257 --> 37:40.341
[screams]

37:41.968 --> 37:43.219
You can't, Grandma, no!

37:44.262 --> 37:45.263
How could you do this?

37:47.056 --> 37:49.141
I can bring her back
if she's breathing. The lamp.

37:49.850 --> 37:52.895
-The lamp, where is it?
-You must spend your last wish on me.

37:54.188 --> 37:56.065
This woman here
isn't breathing any longer.

37:56.148 --> 37:57.650
You better obey,

37:58.234 --> 38:00.361
or your little friend will die too.

38:00.444 --> 38:01.529
[breathing heavily]

38:01.612 --> 38:03.906
But first, we'll open her stomach
and take the thread out.

38:04.991 --> 38:06.117
She swallowed it.

38:10.997 --> 38:12.707
-[screams]
-[Min-ji] No!

38:12.790 --> 38:14.500
-[sobbing]
-No! No!

38:15.418 --> 38:16.627
No!

38:16.711 --> 38:17.795
-[gunshot]
-[yelps]

38:18.587 --> 38:19.922
[gasping]

38:21.382 --> 38:22.758
Charge!

38:31.392 --> 38:33.978
-Let's go!
-[all yelling]

38:35.146 --> 38:37.398
[all grunting and yelling]

38:45.406 --> 38:47.742
-Take those two to the cellar!
-[Ka-young] Grandma.

38:49.952 --> 38:52.538
[all grunting]

39:02.715 --> 39:04.842
Dr. Choi. Help me lift her. Pull her up.

39:07.553 --> 39:08.596
[groans]

39:10.306 --> 39:11.223
[Ejllael grunts]

39:15.019 --> 39:18.147
[somber ethereal music playing]

39:22.818 --> 39:26.155
[yelling] This is your once chance
to finish me off, so why don't you do it?

39:32.161 --> 39:33.662
Just kill me! Do it already!

39:35.081 --> 39:36.707
There is something you still have to do.

39:38.793 --> 39:40.294
You must slit my throat.

39:42.546 --> 39:43.381
[sighs]

39:44.131 --> 39:45.383
-Move.
-[grunts]

39:50.971 --> 39:52.390
[deep rumbling]

39:55.226 --> 39:57.061
[Shadi] Please, my brother.

39:57.144 --> 39:59.021
I walked all night,

40:00.648 --> 40:04.860
found you, and tied you up
for this one reason.

40:07.238 --> 40:09.031
End my son's life.

40:10.491 --> 40:12.159
[yelps, grunts]

40:17.832 --> 40:20.084
You are dead! I'll kill you right now!

40:20.167 --> 40:22.086
Rub the lamp right now!

40:22.169 --> 40:24.338
Make your final wish! Make me his master!

40:24.422 --> 40:26.132
Wish that the lamp be mine!

40:26.215 --> 40:30.177
Instead of doing that,
I'd rather just do this.

40:32.138 --> 40:34.598
-[screams]
-You really are a psychopath.

40:35.182 --> 40:38.185
-Wanna get stabbed?
-Do it. Do it!

40:38.769 --> 40:41.063
Oh, yeah? Allow me to oblige!

40:43.649 --> 40:45.693
-[choking]
-[breathing heavily]

40:49.321 --> 40:52.199
[in deep voice] I saw it
a thousand years ago,

40:52.283 --> 40:53.534
when you were dying,

40:54.076 --> 40:57.580
Iblis revealed the lamp himself
so he might save you.

40:57.663 --> 40:59.707
[continues choking]

40:59.790 --> 41:03.878
As my owner, you must swear, though,
to use the first of your wishes

41:03.961 --> 41:06.464
to save the life of this girl here.

41:07.006 --> 41:08.090
[choking]

41:09.258 --> 41:10.968
[breathing heavily]

41:11.051 --> 41:12.428
[wind whistling]

41:16.182 --> 41:20.186
It would be beautiful
if history were to repeat itself.

41:20.853 --> 41:21.854
So, hurry up, Iblis.

41:22.605 --> 41:23.522
[grunts]

41:23.606 --> 41:25.774
[dramatic orchestral music plays]

41:26.734 --> 41:28.444
-[grunts]
-[choking]

41:29.945 --> 41:31.655
[yelling]

41:46.879 --> 41:48.839
-[Khalid] No!
-[gasping]

41:50.925 --> 41:52.343
-[gasping]
-Father.

41:53.511 --> 41:55.221
No!

41:55.304 --> 41:57.056
[Wahid] Father!

42:00.226 --> 42:02.645
[dramatic orchestral music continues]

42:07.858 --> 42:08.984
[Irem screams]

42:10.861 --> 42:11.737
[Irem whimpers]

42:14.406 --> 42:16.450
[groaning]

42:19.245 --> 42:20.829
[groans, pants]

42:23.332 --> 42:27.670
The thing you've been striving for,
to finally end the war.

42:30.839 --> 42:31.674
No.

42:33.509 --> 42:35.135
What I strived for…

42:37.304 --> 42:39.348
was to win.

42:41.559 --> 42:44.144
[breathing sharply]

42:48.482 --> 42:51.694
Father? [screaming] Father!

42:52.987 --> 42:55.197
You bitch, I'll kill you! [grunts]

42:59.535 --> 43:01.579
[gasping]

43:11.714 --> 43:13.591
Are you okay? Are you hurt?

43:15.217 --> 43:17.595
Grandma is… Grandma and Sade are…

43:21.265 --> 43:23.267
[sorrowful music plays]

43:48.125 --> 43:50.127
[rain pattering]

43:59.720 --> 44:01.972
[siren wailing]

44:04.475 --> 44:06.602
[EMT] The victim was
without pulse upon arrival.

44:07.645 --> 44:08.937
Bullet wound through her chest.

44:10.314 --> 44:11.899
-Call the Jeil Hospital ER.
-No.

44:13.192 --> 44:15.194
Take her directly to the mortuary.

44:18.322 --> 44:20.324
-She's been dead a while.
-I know.

44:20.866 --> 44:24.787
But according to law, a morgue can't
take her until a doctor declares her dead.

44:25.537 --> 44:27.373
-We also need to identify her.
-I know her.

44:28.457 --> 44:29.875
And I can confirm her death.

44:31.835 --> 44:34.338
Dentists can pronounce
an official death too.

44:35.589 --> 44:36.715
Ms. Oh Pan-geum.

44:38.550 --> 44:40.177
I pronounce her officially dead.

44:40.886 --> 44:41.929
October 5th.

44:47.142 --> 44:48.477
6:20 p.m.

44:51.105 --> 44:52.398
Time of death.

44:52.481 --> 44:54.692
[melancholy music playing]

44:58.821 --> 45:00.447
[sobbing]

45:10.916 --> 45:13.836
[Iblis] I will now also give sorrow to you

45:17.131 --> 45:20.634
I will give you sorrow
Which is more precious than love

45:24.388 --> 45:27.724
Other genie, what questions
did Oh Pan-geum ask the most

45:27.808 --> 45:28.809
besides the weather?

45:29.393 --> 45:32.354
[AI Genie] Ms. Oh Pan-geum searched
the following in order of frequency.

45:32.938 --> 45:34.982
"Ways to heal my dear Ka-young's illness."

45:35.774 --> 45:37.359
"How to fix a psychopath."

45:38.235 --> 45:40.195
"Foods that are good for psychopaths."

45:42.906 --> 45:46.827
[Iblis] On a blustery winter's night with
A few tangerines laid out on the street

45:46.910 --> 45:48.704
KA-YOUNG, YOU'RE BEAUTIFUL TODAY AS ALWAYS

45:48.787 --> 45:51.457
Sold by an old woman
Shivering with a lifetime of cold

45:51.540 --> 45:53.375
FROM SORROW TO JOY
POETRY BY JEONG HO-SEUNG

45:53.459 --> 45:56.670
To you, who was happy
To haggle the price of tangerines

46:03.343 --> 46:06.472
I shall show you the equal face of sorrow

46:16.523 --> 46:18.567
When I called to you from the shadows

46:24.239 --> 46:25.574
-[crying]
-Please leave us.

46:27.075 --> 46:28.994
We will wash and dress the deceased.

46:29.077 --> 46:30.537
[Min-jae crying] Please, leave us.

46:31.163 --> 46:34.041
[Iblis] Not once did you show me
An equal smile

46:35.667 --> 46:36.793
OH PAN-GEUM

46:36.877 --> 46:39.338
When someone huddled under a straw sack
Freezes to death

46:39.421 --> 46:42.257
GRANDCHILD: KI KA-YOUNG

46:43.759 --> 46:46.678
You did not so much as put
A single straw over them

46:52.893 --> 46:54.478
For your indifferent love

46:57.439 --> 46:59.525
For your tears
That seem incapable of flowing

47:04.446 --> 47:05.322
It's painful.

47:05.405 --> 47:08.825
[Iblis] I will now also give wait to you

47:11.703 --> 47:13.997
Just deal with the pain for today.

47:15.999 --> 47:17.292
You have to.

47:18.043 --> 47:20.170
I thought I made all the right decisions.

47:22.589 --> 47:26.802
Grandma is lying in a casket,
and now I'm miserable, so get off!

47:26.885 --> 47:28.220
Miserable?

47:29.137 --> 47:32.349
You're miserable because you don't like
that you made a bad decision?

47:33.225 --> 47:34.518
It's not just you.

47:35.477 --> 47:38.647
I lost Grandma. I was in love…

47:42.401 --> 47:43.860
even though it was brief.

47:50.576 --> 47:51.410
[sighs]

47:55.706 --> 47:57.124
So you need to bear it too.

47:58.625 --> 47:59.710
[Min-ji sniffles]

48:01.169 --> 48:02.796
If I make a choice for someone,

48:04.715 --> 48:06.925
everyone's unhappy afterwards.

48:08.427 --> 48:09.803
[young Min-ji] Be my friend.

48:09.886 --> 48:11.930
And what if I don't
wanna be friends with you?

48:12.681 --> 48:16.018
-You and I are both negative ones.
-You have no other option.

48:16.602 --> 48:18.228
So, we are friends from now on.

48:19.104 --> 48:20.480
You're terrible at school.

48:22.107 --> 48:24.192
So it appears I'm a negative one still.

48:30.741 --> 48:33.118
Your mother offers this
to offset the costs.

48:35.162 --> 48:35.996
[sighs]

48:36.663 --> 48:39.583
[Iblis] I will stop the blizzard of snow
That fell on the world

48:42.169 --> 48:45.297
You said you were going
somewhere nicer than Hawaii.

48:46.006 --> 48:48.175
How have you returned to us like this?

48:48.258 --> 48:50.177
[low chattering]

48:56.308 --> 48:58.101
[Ka-young's aunt crying]

49:01.313 --> 49:03.482
[Ka-young's aunt sobbing]

49:09.404 --> 49:12.407
[Iblis] I will take the spring snow
That fell on the barley fields

49:13.867 --> 49:17.663
And take them to visit the sorrow
Of the people shivering with cold

49:21.291 --> 49:23.126
I will walk the snowy paths

49:24.920 --> 49:26.922
No longer snowing, with you

49:33.220 --> 49:35.222
[Ka-young's aunt bawling]

49:36.139 --> 49:40.852
Oh, my gosh. She behaves like this
at her grandma's funeral?

49:41.645 --> 49:44.731
Such a strange, strange girl.
Not even crying.

49:51.863 --> 49:54.491
Do you have to act so strange today? Huh?

49:55.242 --> 49:57.828
I knew from the start
Gyeong-seok should've held it!

49:57.911 --> 49:59.538
[wailing]

50:01.790 --> 50:03.250
Ma!

50:05.544 --> 50:08.672
Mama! [wailing]

50:10.757 --> 50:13.677
Mama!

50:13.760 --> 50:15.679
[bawling]

50:16.596 --> 50:17.681
[mourners murmuring]

50:17.764 --> 50:19.975
[Iblis] We will talk
Of the power of sorrow

50:22.978 --> 50:24.646
And walk all the way

50:25.939 --> 50:27.816
To the sorrow of waiting

50:36.158 --> 50:38.368
[sentimental music plays]
